<title>USA: Peumansend Creek Jail Auth, Va., yields 5.70 pct.</title>
<headline>Peumansend Creek Jail Auth, Va., yields 5.70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craigie Inc said it priced $10.370 million of Peumansend Creek Regional Jail Authority, Va., regional jail facility revenue bonds, Series 1997 with a top yield of 5.70 percent in 2017.</p>
</text>
